  "specId": "316-agent-timeout-settlement",
  "issue": 411,
  "request": "Goal: Resolve F-005 so agent subprocesses always settle after timeout. Scope: src/lib/agent.js; add ChildProcessSupervisor and AgentTimeoutError; cover tests/agent and tests/unit/lib. Ensure timeout sends SIGTERM immediately, escalates to SIGKILL after a grace period, settles close/error/timeout exactly once, cleans all listeners and timers, returns within timeout plus grace plus margin, and leaves neither child nor descendants alive. Add failure reproduction before implementation and prove the issue acceptance criteria with automated tests; preserve existing success paths. Out of scope: unrelated audit findings, publishing, dist-tags, and releases.",
